<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Night</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">keshi</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Requiem</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4xlkIVboOY2plOALp9bqD8</ttm:item><itunes:duration>02:59.000</itunes:duration></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.520" end="00:10.770">Hard to breathe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.770" end="00:15.330">Every move I make I feel them watching me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.330" end="00:18.000">Try to run away but I can't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.000" end="00:22.620">Seem to make a sound</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.620" end="00:27.160">But I keep screaming out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.160" end="00:31.610">All my body all the rest I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.610" end="00:39.230">Gave it up and all that's left is you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.230" end="00:45.800">Try to reach but I can't move</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.800" end="00:48.030">Oooooo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.030" end="00:52.600">Waiting for the light</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.600" end="00:57.700">I can't close my eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.700" end="01:01.610">When I'm alone I hear it calling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.610" end="01:05.410">So save me from the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.410" end="01:07.580">Save me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.580" end="01:10.120">Oh give me the light</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.120" end="01:12.170">Save me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.170" end="01:14.680">I'm closing my eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.680" end="01:16.320">Save me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.320" end="01:18.710">I won't be the same me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.710" end="01:20.240">Somebody wake me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.240" end="01:28.240">So save me from the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.430" end="01:34.610">Terrified</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.610" end="01:39.180">I kill all the parts of me to stay alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.180" end="01:41.840">Do or die it's all or nothing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.840" end="01:44.230">Running out of time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.230" end="01:46.530">I've been out my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.530" end="01:51.010">I can't pay the price</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.010" end="01:55.490">All my body all the rest I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.490" end="02:01.330">Gave it up and all that's left is you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.330" end="02:03.080">All that's left is you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.080" end="02:08.990">Try to reach but I can't move</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.990" end="02:11.870">Oooooo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.870" end="02:16.430">Waiting for the light</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.430" end="02:21.540">I can't close my eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.540" end="02:25.510">When I'm alone I hear it calling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.510" end="02:29.280">So save me from the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.280" end="02:31.400">Save me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.400" end="02:33.950">Oh give me the light</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.950" end="02:35.970">Save me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.970" end="02:38.590">I'm closing my eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.590" end="02:40.090">Save me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.010" end="02:42.590">I won't be the same me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.590" end="02:44.120">Somebody wake me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.120" end="02:48.120">So save me from the night</p></div></body></tt>